---
description: Sandbox, test, and specimen pages render only in dev
globs: Code/src/pages/**, Code/astro.config.mjs
alwaysApply: false
---

Auto-attaches when editing pages or the Astro config. Sandbox, test, specimen, and
sample pages render only under `npm run dev`, never in staging or production.

- Put them in `Code/src/pages/dev/` as dynamic routes whose `getStaticPaths` returns `[]`
  unless `import.meta.env.DEV`. A static page there still ships.
- Keep fictional or placeholder content in components, never in a page file.
- Never weaken the build guard in `Code/astro.config.mjs` that fails on `/dev/` pages.

Full guidance: `Agents/context/dev-only-pages.md`.
